<script src="/etc.clientlibs/forge/components/content/rte/v2/rte/clientlibs/publish.min.js"></script>



	   
		   
			
			 
			  <div class="RichText   ">
			   <p>EquityClear is LCH Ltd's pan-European CCP clearing service,&nbsp;registered in the UK, for equities and equity equivalents. Collaboration with our market partners enables us to develop innovative solutions that enhance customers’ risk management and mitigate systemic risk, whilst delivering operational and settlement efficiencies.&nbsp;</p>
<p>EquityClear has the capacity to clear large trading volumes, driven by the increasing activity of diverse market participants who achieve significant reductions in settlement costs through cross-trade venue settlement netting.</p>

			  </div>
	   
   
   



    
    

    
    

                </div>
